{
  "text": "The latest stable release of Kotlin is **Kotlin 1.9.22**, which was published on **December 21, 2023**. You can find more details about this release on the official GitHub page [here](https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/releases/tag/v1.9.22). \n\nAdditionally, prior to this, Kotlin 1.9.20 was released on **November 1, 2023**, marking an important milestone with the K2 compiler for all targets now in Beta and Kotlin Multiplatform becoming stable. More information can be found on the JetBrains blog [here](https://blog.jetbrains.com/kotlin/2023/11/kotlin-1-9-20-released/).",
